   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Management Fees for Operational and Implementation Phase of EU&apos;s Financial Assurance Programme. A Fund Manager will manage DFID&apos;s Funding to UK based NGOs, which will provide them with opportunity to continue to implement ECHO&apos;s programmes.</narrative>
