  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Management Fees for Operational and Implementation Phase of EU&apos;s Financial Assurance Programme. A Fund Manager will manage DFID&apos;s Funding to UK based NGOs, which will provide them with opportunity to continue to implement ECHO&apos;s programmes. is a component of Management of the EU&apos;s Humanitarian and Civil Protection Agency (ECHO) - Financial Assurance for UK implementer&apos;s. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;144,632. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Multisector aid, Relief co-ordination and support services.</narrative>
  </description>
